{"lines":[{"y":0.93023255816353867,"text":"morning? Do we feel that the pain and suffering of our","x":0.13301663495572028,"w":0.81710211023107759,"conf":1,"h":0.021900378522418773},{"conf":1,"x":0.13064133878786593,"w":0.81710211023107759,"h":0.021842700148385741,"text":"people, the evidence of which we see everywhere around us,","y":0.90697674424638741},{"h":0.021825396825396859,"text":"the want and the misery which each day renews, stifle any","conf":1,"x":0.12826603505264295,"y":0.88516865116969379,"w":0.81947742808948854},{"x":0.13064134860575963,"text":"note of thanksgiving and preclude all joyful trust? \"It is the","conf":1,"y":0.86334325425995229,"w":0.81710211023107748,"h":0.02183116428435794},{"w":0.81947742808948876,"text":"goodness of the Lord that we are not utterly perished.\" Yes, but","y":0.8415178567334789,"h":0.020400747420295851,"x":0.12826602835430573,"conf":1},{"text":"perhaps in our case the situation is one of irremediable ruin.","y":0.81820436552163645,"conf":1,"w":0.80522562002206777,"x":0.13064135346877603,"h":0.020458424848223578},{"x":0.16152020832340205,"w":0.78384795746245928,"y":0.79935515846835159,"h":0.017609126984126977,"text":"Is it then that the world in which we live is different from","conf":1},{"h":0.020394979015229242,"text":"that which the pious singer knew? Are the catastrophes which","y":0.77325581425707801,"x":0.12826604021304416,"w":0.81710211023107737,"conf":1},{"w":0.81947742808948876,"text":"have overtaken us terrible beyond anything in his ex-","x":0.12826604299207259,"h":0.021825396825396859,"y":0.74999999956845054,"conf":1},{"text":"perience? With the consequence that we must be silent where","x":0.12826605285867226,"y":0.7281746031048808,"w":0.81710211023107759,"h":0.020371908233279279,"conf":1},{"x":0.12826603913221521,"w":0.81947742808948865,"conf":1,"y":0.70486111087758374,"h":0.021883075199430002,"text":"he could still speak gratefully of God's mercy and faithful-"},{"y":0.6830357142790473,"conf":1,"x":0.12589073315858013,"h":0.020452657389262274,"text":"ness? Is that really so? Consider how he goes on to speak of","w":0.82422801426478798},{"conf":1,"y":0.66259121293231638,"x":0.12818490926674445,"w":0.12367768721147018,"h":0.019294318698701352,"text":"his God:"},{"h":0.026761503446669832,"conf":1,"text":"\"Thou hast wrapped thyself with anger and pursued us,","x":0.1398031845557117,"y":0.62448951632528138,"w":0.77264320076286019},{"text":"slayıng without pity;","conf":1,"y":0.60610465156125215,"h":0.018895348859211736,"w":0.28503561639166497,"x":0.15914489786117467},{"h":0.020360372369251589,"y":0.5828373017845232,"x":0.1591448952199716,"w":0.53444181169782357,"text":"thou hast wrapped thyself with a cloud","conf":1},{"text":"so that no prayer can pass through.","conf":1,"x":0.1567696083181179,"w":0.48693585086178459,"y":0.55952380939401714,"h":0.020418050743284732},{"h":0.020441121525234585,"conf":1,"y":0.53769841305489674,"text":"Thou hast made us offscouring and refuse","x":0.15676960355878097,"w":0.57244655064174099},{"y":0.51587301581912093,"w":0.26365795383205659,"h":0.019097222222222099,"x":0.15914489701508808,"conf":1,"text":"among the peoples."},{"text":"\"All our enemies rail against us;","conf":1,"x":0.13923405357989613,"y":0.48144256313011013,"w":0.44600637857016023,"h":0.030014046600886801},{"text":"panic and pitfall have come upon us,","w":0.51118672358525252,"y":0.45921834428993147,"conf":1,"x":0.15656260150353926,"h":0.024378229701329857},{"y":0.43880877822357323,"h":0.02467733905428926,"w":0.39061675133643203,"x":0.15630158623012155,"text":"devastation and destruction;","conf":1},{"y":0.41860465165598837,"x":0.15676959392522208,"w":0.43942993956726872,"h":0.018895347913106209,"conf":1,"text":"my eyes flow with rivers of tears"},{"w":0.77238830962738425,"x":0.15892386523789065,"y":0.39139323878790611,"text":"because of the destruction of the daughter of my people.","conf":1,"h":0.024359630213843464},{"w":0.69668737634435873,"h":0.026993380652533649,"conf":1,"text":"My eyes will flow without ceasing, without respite,","y":0.36760505726172754,"x":0.15880305238853565},{"h":0.016121031746031744,"text":"until the Lord from heaven","conf":1,"y":0.35317460327088102,"x":0.15676959544162353,"w":0.37292160925927109},{"conf":1,"text":"looks down and sees.\" (3: 43-50.)","y":0.32558139556361121,"w":0.45843228426846594,"x":0.15439430630697851,"h":0.021888842658391083},{"conf":1,"y":0.28946691705399807,"h":0.02470306744651185,"text":"Is it not as though these words were spoken directly out","x":0.15652218032904011,"w":0.78902455119343551},{"conf":1,"x":0.12318831903967285,"y":0.26568713301345526,"w":0.82015911944500808,"h":0.029307210256182881,"text":"of the crisis in which we are living, out of the heart of our"},{"conf":1,"w":0.82014579277533983,"h":0.028712034225463867,"y":0.24353993826261877,"x":0.12321568667144187,"text":"own misery? The same note is struck throughout the whole"},{"conf":1,"y":0.2242294188732995,"w":0.45257018448470471,"h":0.026489104543413466,"x":0.12528256498042206,"text":"Book of Lamentations. It begins:"},{"y":0.19213963178888283,"x":0.1988229590861906,"conf":1,"text":"\"How lonely sits the city","h":0.026124087591019918,"w":0.34341041763107494},{"text":"that was full of people!","h":0.020452657389262274,"y":0.17151162822267885,"x":0.21852731007129486,"w":0.31828979393104451,"conf":1},{"y":0.14506934740170851,"conf":1,"w":0.48385828191583807,"text":"How like a widow has she become,","h":0.030269263282654779,"x":0.2177848306900006},{"x":0.21598924353793594,"text":"she that was great among the nations!\" (I: I.)","y":0.12466023767646883,"conf":1,"h":0.022811989935617616,"w":0.62745374208920968},{"w":0.2384110735608386,"conf":1,"y":0.098703171484520347,"h":0.019889420933193569,"text":"And it continues:","x":0.12548302149354754},{"x":0.50593824162054035,"conf":1,"text":"224","w":0.049881235345617503,"h":0.01744185932098874,"y":0.068313954278459099}],"page":220,"w":7029,"h":11508}